    "en": "The outline of his Ghost dissolves into starlight. Fear drains; relief rises. He is released from the prison of infinity and returns to the greater flow.",
    "ja": "彼はわずかに鼻で笑った。「あなたとそのAIが“仲良し”でも、私の評価は変わらない」"
